{"candidateAnswer":"J.K. Rowling","evidence":"[D15:7 | 5:51 pm on 21 October, 2023] Tim: J.K. Rowling is such an inspiring writer. Her books are so captivating with their detail and creative storytelling. She can definitely transport readers into another world and make them feel so much. I'm always taking notes on her style for my own writing.","itemId":"urn:uuid:06b011d7-006e-5cd3-a3e4-c3b7c993a28a","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:dbaf0f213e4c3ca9ad3fac81abbf165616d12d185afa939f9e4dc89f896d8447","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who is one of Tim's sources of inspiration for writing?","referenceAnswer":"J.K. Rowling","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"dbaf0f213e4c3ca9ad3fac81abbf165616d12d185afa939f9e4dc89f896d8447"}}]}